Voice clips in this directory (*.wav)

Synthesised with Kokoro-82M (https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro), an
open-weight text-to-speech model released under the Apache License 2.0,
run through kokoro-onnx (MIT). Voices: am_michael (caller), af_heart
(agent). Trimmed of leading and trailing silence, resampled to 16 kHz mono.

The lines are original to this project and are released with it under MIT.
